Sorts a list of integers, by insertion. It uses insert from lib/insert.prog, which is imported as a standard library function.
---
insert = lib/insert.prog
---
(lam xs
  (letrec s (lam l (if (? l) ~ (insert [(head l) (s (tail l))])))
    (s xs)))
---
~ => ~ fuel 100000
[3 1 2 ~] => [1 2 3 ~] fuel 100000
[5 5 1 ~] => [1 5 5 ~] fuel 100000
[-1 0 -3 ~] => [-3 -1 0 ~] fuel 100000
